hev-socks5-tunnel's 9bb1035, "HevSocks5Tunnel: Make max-session-count hold under churn" (#339), on 2.19.3.
One change: hev_socks5_tunnel_insert_session is not static, so scripts/check-frameworks.sh finds it in the build.

--- a/src/hev-socks5-tunnel.c
+++ b/src/hev-socks5-tunnel.c
@@ -61,6 +61,7 @@ static atomic_int tsync;
